# Nested workspace manifests are not part of the published surface: the root
# manifest is the single authoritative dependency declaration, and nested
# manifests would otherwise ship unrewritten workspace: specifiers. The
# two-level packages/cli/jsx-transformer/package.json stays because it is a
# module-boundary manifest (no name, no dependencies).
packages/*/package.json
